          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Josua Tuisova returns as Ben Volavola starts at No. 10 for Fiji",
          "body": "Jake White has recalled Josua Tuisova and Caleb Muntz for Fiji's Nations Championship test against Ireland in Dublin on Saturday, though Muntz starts on the bench. Ben Volavola takes the No. 10 jersey, partnering scrum-half Frank Lomani, and Peceli Yato captains the side from No. 8. Mesake Vocevoce drops from the second row into the back row, while Ponipate Loganimasi comes in at fullback. Tuisova lines up at first centre alongside Setareki Bituniyata."
