      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Julien Marchand returns to start at hooker against Malcolm Marx",
          "body": "Friday's Stade de France test will pit two of the world's best hookers against each other: France's Julien Marchand and South Africa's Malcolm Marx. Rugbyrama reports that Marchand is back in France's starting side, with head coach Fabien Galthié's team missing several key players. Former France captain Guilhem Guirado says the Springboks have plenty of effective jackalers, so Marchand's ability to steal ball may be almost vital, and he is eager to see how Marchand copes with South African clear-outs."
        },
