          "heading": "Scotland starlet Tom Lambert ends up in Wallabies squad via Glasgow Warriors",
          "body": "Australia's gain is Scotland's headache this week, with a Scotland starlet now in the Wallabies set-up. The Scotsman reports that Tom Lambert's route to the Wallabies ran through Glasgow Warriors, which makes the switch a Scottish pathway story as much as an Australian selection one. Scotland come into the Australia match after a 21-43 defeat to New Zealand in Round 4."
